VisRO task design
Many VisRO tasks are procedural counterparts of task types in the BabyVision
benchmark (Chen et al., "BabyVision: Visual Reasoning Beyond Language", ICML
2026); their layouts, visual styles and answer formats follow BabyVision's
examples. The maze lattice families follow "Thinking with Visual Primitives"
(Lu et al., 2026). No BabyVision images or code are included; see
README.md (Acknowledgements).
